# Allowlist. Everything else Claude Code keeps in ~/.claude -- transcripts,
# history, caches, installed plugins, skills synced from the claude.ai account
# -- is machine-local and must never land here, even if this directory is ever
# linked wholesale. Add a `!/<name>` line to version another entry; every
# tracked entry is linked into ~/.claude by nix/modules/home/claude.nix.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/settings.json
!/agents/
!/scripts/
!/skills/
/skills/synced/
/skills/.trash/
